  "html": "<p>Rattle Tooth's Family Friends are a large group of Whisker <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Champions\" title=\"Category:Champions\">Champions</a> who can be found by pairs on Level 2, 4 &amp; 6 of <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>, and the two largest are guarding Vergrim in <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Lair of the Vergrim</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Townston_Commander\" title=\"Townston Commander\">Townston Commander</a> gives quests to dispose of them.  They are a varied bunch and seem to spawn randomly on the various levels so you may not encounter the same ones twice.\n</p><p>Here are some that have been sighted:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Rattle Ear's Interior Decorator\n</li><li>Rattle Ear's Cook\n</li><li>Rattle Eye's Co-Worker\n</li><li>Rattle Eye's Sidekick\n</li><li>Rattle Toe's Personal Masseur\n</li><li>Rattle Toe's Photographer\n</li><li>Rattle Toe's Supervisor\n</li><li>Rattle Toe's Sweetheart\n</li><li>Rattle Tooth's Acquaintance\n</li><li>Rattle Tooth's Cellmate\n</li><li>Rattle Tooth's DJ\n</li><li>Rattle Tooth's Yoga Instructor\n</li></ul>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rtr_blademaster.jpg\" title=\"Rattle Ear's Interior Decorater\"><img alt=\"Rattle Ear's Interior Decorater\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"97\" src=\"/images/Rtr_blademaster.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rtr_blademaster.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Rattle Ear's Interior Decorater</b></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rtr_broodling.jpg\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Cellmate\"><img alt=\"Rattle Tooth's Cellmate\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"153\" src=\"/images/Rtr_broodling.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rtr_broodling.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Rattle Tooth's Cellmate</b></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rtr_shaman.jpg\" title=\"Rattle Ear's Cook\"><img alt=\"Rattle Ear's Cook\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"111\" src=\"/images/Rtr_shaman.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rtr_shaman.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Rattle Ear's Cook</b></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rtr_spitter.jpg\" title=\"Rattle Toe's Photographer\"><img alt=\"Rattle Toe's Photographer\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"145\" src=\"/images/Rtr_spitter.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rtr_spitter.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Rattle Toe's Photographer</b></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
